                                "sense_id": "f24a9128-9f64-3c58-a176-d40c8312f83e",
                                "text": "Another critic observes Gandhism dreads the 'onslaught of technology' because it creates unemployment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "331629b1-1b9c-4f36-969f-1aacae9fab12",
                                "sense_id": "f24a9128-9f64-3c58-a176-d40c8312f83e",
                                "text": "In trying to curb modern political Machiavellianism, some of the more consistent humanists find this analogy in the ethical ideas and the political practice of Gandhiism."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
